# Published archive keeps only lib/, example/, doc/, skills/, README.md,
# CHANGELOG.md, LICENSE, and pubspec.yaml. Everything below is dev/CI/test
# tooling that must not ship to pub.dev.
#
# ANCHORING IS LOAD-BEARING. .pubignore uses gitignore semantics, so a BARE
# `config/` matches a directory named `config` at ANY DEPTH — including
# `lib/src/config/`. That is exactly how diene_auth_engine 1.0.0 and 1.0.1
# shipped WITHOUT `lib/src/config/auth_engine_config.dart` while
# `lib/diene_auth_engine.dart` line 22 still exports it: both archives are
# structurally unusable, every consumer fails to compile with
# "Type 'AuthEngineConfig' not found", and publication is irreversible.
# The intent was always the repo-root layers. `config/`, `test/` and `tool/` are
# anchored below: `config` is the LIVE defect, and `test`/`tool` are anchored
# because `lib/src/test/` and `lib/src/tool/` are plausible future paths that
# would fail the same silent way.
#
# The other 11 bare patterns are left as-is DELIBERATELY, to keep this interim a
# minimal diff against the parent it will be replaced by. Audited over the 31
# tracked ship-scope files (lib/ example/ doc/ skills/): `config` was the only
# collision; .claude .dart_tool .direnv .github .kagent .kloop coverage docs nix
# scripts tasks all scored 0. They are latent, not safe — re-audit if a new
# subdirectory is added under lib/.
#
# INTERIM — SUPERSEDED BY THE PARENT MERGE.
#   owner:   dart-lib (packages/diene_dart_lib/.pubignore)
#   session: carl (node-worker:dart-lib-bundle)
#   shape:   R-E8a latency clause. This is a recorded parent obligation, NOT an
#            independent per-branch port. dart-lib still carries the bare
#            `config/` at authoritative 602610f, and EVERY dart lib inherits it.
#   on_cascade: resolve IN FAVOUR OF THE PARENT and DELETE this interim block;
#            do not merge around it. See exec/nodes/lib__dart__auth-engine/
#            node.json -> evidence.parent_obligations[pubignore-unanchored-config].
.claude/
.dart_tool/
.direnv/
.github/
.kagent/
.kloop/
/config/
